  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Third public prerelease candidate. Implements GetServerDirectory/domain discovery end to end, including SCL-seeded logical devices and continueAfter handling. Corrects MMS BER interoperability found during a live IEDExplorer session: standard Identify/GetNameList/GetVariableAccessAttributes/Read and named-variable-list shapes, service tags, recursive TypeSpecification and structured FC reads, dataset attributes, service advertisement, and separation of BER envelope depth from negotiated MMS data nesting. Adds literal IEDExplorer-shaped regression vectors, server-boundary tests, and fuzz seeds. Live IEDExplorer discovery, initialization, reads, and cyclic polling were verified against the built-in simulator. Setting Group Control, Substitution, and SetFile upload are explicitly excluded from the v1 scope.",
